NexcoreCtrlComputer
===================

Copyright (c) 2026 NexcoreCtrlComputer contributors.

NexcoreCtrlComputer is an independent orchestration layer. It does not bundle
or copy source code from the projects below. It invokes their documented CLIs
or APIs as optional runtime backends.

agent-desktop
https://github.com/vercel-labs/agent-desktop
License: Apache-2.0
Use: accessibility-first desktop observation and semantic actions.

agent-browser
https://github.com/vercel-labs/agent-browser
License: Apache-2.0
Use: browser automation through the Chrome DevTools Protocol and compact
accessibility snapshots.

PyAutoGUI
https://github.com/asweigart/pyautogui
License: BSD-3-Clause
Use: explicitly enabled coordinate fallback for canvas or inaccessible UI.

See each upstream project for its complete license, notices, security guidance,
and platform requirements.
